# CR 601.2h: the same {C/W} shard declined in favor of its colourless side --
# ChoosePayColorlessHybrid false -- resolves to a plain colourless mana.ShardC
# instead, which only a colourless source in the pool (not any old leftover
# color) can pay.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 C
queue paycolorlesshybrid false
paymanacost human C/W
